{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As a cute penguin in a kayak, paddle in an obstacle course while avoiding swinging hammers, spinning walls, falling spike balls and more to reach the end. Why? Uhh.. good question, I'm not sure either, but it's probably very important.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With realistic kayak physics, paddle solo or team up with a friend\u2026 well, the physics are as realistic as a penguin in a kayak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936250/extras/f8c1e7df132a28178031fb041a1a93da.poster.avif?t=1772662329\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936250/extras/f8c1e7df132a28178031fb041a1a93da.webm?t=1772662329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936250/extras/f8c1e7df132a28178031fb041a1a93da.mp4?t=1772662329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many stages of<span class=\"bb_strike\">\u00a0pain</span>\u00a0fun!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of stages\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">each</span>\u00a0with unique concepts ensure that gameplay never feels repetitive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid swinging, spinning, falling deadly obstacles, play a memory game while trying to stay on a moving platform, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 game modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal - Checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard - No checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmare - Game over if the kayak touches any obstacle.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beat Normal Mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3936250/0692b98c3908e95cae617864cee405ac9e0915bd.jpg"},{"name":"Beat Hard